{title: Love Divine, All Loves Excelling}
{artist: Charles Wesley / Rowland Prichard}
{genre: Hymn}
{style: Traditional}
{flow: Meditative}
{key: G}
{tempo: 88}
{time: 4/4}
{hymnal: 새찬송가 15장}
{title_ko: 하나님의 크신 사랑}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Love divine, all [C]loves ex[G]celling
[D]Joy of heaven, to [G]earth come [D]down
[G]Fix in us Thy [C]humble [G]dwelling
[D]All Thy faithful [G]mercies [D]crown
[G]Jesus, Thou art [C]all com[G]passion
[D]Pure, unbounded [G]love Thou [D]art
[G]Visit us with [C]Thy sal[G]vation
[D]Enter every [G]trembling heart
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Breathe, O breathe Thy [C]loving [G]Spirit
[D]Into every [G]troubled [D]breast
[G]Let us all in [C]Thee in[G]herit
[D]Let us find that [G]second [D]rest
[G]Take away our [C]bent to [G]sinning
[D]Alpha and O[G]mega [D]be
[G]End of faith, as [C]its be[G]ginning
[D]Set our hearts at [G]liberty
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]Come, Almighty [C]to de[G]liver
[D]Let us all Thy [G]life re[D]ceive
[G]Suddenly re[C]turn, and [G]never
[D]Nevermore Thy [G]temples [D]leave
[G]Thee we would be [C]always [G]blessing
[D]Serve Thee as Thy [G]hosts a[D]bove
[G]Pray and praise Thee [C]without [G]ceasing
[D]Glory in Thy [G]perfect love
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[G]Finish then Thy [C]new cre[G]ation
[D]Pure and spotless [G]let us [D]be
[G]Let us see Thy [C]great sal[G]vation
[D]Perfectly re[G]stored in [D]Thee
[G]Changed from glory [C]into [G]glory
[D]Till in heaven we [G]take our [D]place
[G]Till we cast our [C]crowns be[G]fore Thee
[D]Lost in wonder, [G]love, and praise
{end_of_verse}
